/T (Fire Starters are an easy and natural way to get your fire pit or wood burning fire place going without the use of fuels. Place the fire starter into your fire pit/fire place and light the wick. It is recommended that you place the fire starter on a small flat piece of wood so that the air can travel around it, make sure that the wick has access to the wood, and watch your fire start!  Fire starters are safe for indoor wood burning fireplaces.  The soy wax completely burns up so there is no residue or remaining wax \(as long as the fire can burn in full before being put out\). The fire starter scents WILL NOT over power the fire scent once the fire pit/ fireplace has been started. Fire starters are not made to change the smell of fire.)
